WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.760 align:start position:19%
They were in high spirits. Then,
nothing. Silence. On February 20th, a

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:14.400 align:start position:19%
search party of students and soldiers
set out into the frozen Urals. Six days

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:19.720 align:start position:19%
later, they found the tent, half
collapsed, half buried, on the slope of

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:25.000 align:start position:19%
the dead mountain. The tent was slashed
open from the inside.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:31.320 align:start position:19%
Long, desperate cuts, as if they'd fled
in blind panic. Inside, boots, warm

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:36.120 align:start position:19%
clothes, food, money, cameras,
everything abandoned. People don't leave

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:41.160 align:start position:19%
survival gear behind. Outside,
footprints led downhill toward the

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:47.040 align:start position:19%
forest. Some in socks, some in a single
boot, one completely barefoot. In minus

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.040 align:start position:19%
30

